ools are usually run by a religious order, i.e., the Society of Jesus or Congregation of Christian Brothers, etc.", 'question': 'Topic: Private school\nWhat is the Irish term for private schools?', 'answer': 'scoil phríobháideach'}], 'lora_rank': 32, 'lora_alpha': 64, 'lora_dropout': 0.0, 'finetune_epochs': 10, 'finetune_lr': 0.001, 'batch_size': 1, 'gradient_accumulation_steps': 1, 'end_mask_substring': ''}
